{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"生田さん、みり愛、絢音、蘭世の４人で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しゃぶしゃぶに行った際に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山崎怜奈の話題で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１時間半も話したらしいですが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"内容が全く想定できなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もはや恐怖でしかないです(( ¯•_•¯ ))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず、何かやらかしていたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい(T . T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖くて本人に聞けない。でも気になるなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2016/11/22/9892484/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突然ですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今から特になんでもないお話しをしますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前メイクさんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おこづかいの話になって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしは小学校１年生のときから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すでにお小遣い制だったし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お小遣い帳も付けさせられていたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが普通だと思っていたから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビックリされてこっちもビックリしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小1から乃木坂に入る高1の春までずっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お小遣い制だったし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学校